{
  "comment": "Where an action is offered and how strongly (SPEC \u00a73, Link 1.1). surfaces: the action's own list, else derived from accepts; always includes palette when derived; compared as a set. oneClick: marked oneClick, not interactive, and no overwrites-files, deletes-files, uploads-content or executes-commands effect. rank: per offered kind, the highest rank whose pattern takes the kind (capped at 100); without rank, 60 when featuredFor takes it. A malformed Link 1.1 field reads as absent.",
  "actions": [
    {
      "name": "image converter: surfaces from accepts",
      "action": {
        "id": "x.a",
        "title": "A",
        "accepts": [
          "file/image",
          "file/image[]"
        ]
      },
      "surfaces": [
        "browser-download",
        "browser-image",
        "file-menu",
        "palette"
      ],
      "oneClick": false,
      "rank": {
        "file/image": 0
      }
    },
